"Big screen + small screen: the big screen sits between two columns of controls, the other small beside them; tap the small one (or ⇅) to swap. Side by side, controls below: both screens across the top with every control in a band underneath, nothing covered. Side by side at the top: both screens as large as the width allows, flush with the top. The overlay layouts are Azahar's, with the controls drawn over the screens. ⇅ swaps the screens in every layout." = "Tela grande + tela pequena: a grande fica entre duas colunas de controles e a outra, pequena, ao lado; toque na pequena (ou ⇅) para trocar. Lado a lado, controles embaixo: as duas telas no topo com todos os controles numa faixa embaixo, nada coberto. Lado a lado no topo: as duas telas do maior tamanho que a largura permite, coladas no topo. Os layouts sobrepostos são os do Azahar, com os controles por cima das telas. ⇅ troca as telas em todos os layouts.";
